  "question": {
    "text": "The value of integral $\\int_{-1}^1 \\frac{|x+2|}{x+2} d x$ is"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "1",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "2",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "0",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "-1",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "B"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "Hints : $I=\\int_{-1}^1 \\frac{|x+2|}{x+2} d x \\quad, \\quad x+2=v \\Rightarrow d x=d v$\n$$\n\\therefore \\mathrm{I}=\\int_1^3 \\frac{|v|}{V} d v=\\int_1^3 \\frac{v}{V} d v=\\int_1^3 d v=2\n$$"
  }
}